{"id":"n22264-2-2","stage":2,"title":"관계없다 · 没关系","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n22264-2-2-1","ko":"남은 음식은 제가 가져가도 관계없지요?","zh":"剩下的食物让我拿走也没关系吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"남은","meaning":"剩，剩下","explanation":"남다：剩，剩下；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"남다","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64552","senseId":"1","lemma":"남다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남은","audio":"/audio/0736fbdfe295646df99b.mp3"}},{"text":"음식은","meaning":"饮食，饭菜","explanation":"음식：饮食，饭菜；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"음식","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71114","senseId":"1","lemma":"음식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음식은","audio":"/audio/caadce091d673a3db51d.mp3"}},{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제가","audio":"/audio/c1f551b0d681d02645e2.mp3"}},{"text":"가져가도","meaning":"带走，拿走","explanation":"가져가다：带走，拿走；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"가져가다","audio":"/audio/d96cfec150bdc38f4c11.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53811","senseId":"1","lemma":"가져가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가져가도","audio":"/audio/60c846a13b29151b0757.mp3"}},{"text":"관계없지요?","meaning":"没关系，不成问题","explanation":"관계없다：没关系，不成问题；지요：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"관계없다","audio":"/audio/e17776ee0f74297e4ba9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22264","senseId":"2","lemma":"관계없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"관계없지요","audio":"/audio/f988105d9853b44cc717.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"10946131f919fe80","term":"남다","zh":"剩，剩下","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3","entryId":"64552","definition":"没用